.superpowers/

.worktrees/
.work/put_debug.log

# Local-only credential script for relay auto-reconnect (CLAUDE.md 2026-09-03
# amendment) -- must never be committed, this machine only.
replay.ps1

# Local DuckDB evidence store (evidence-db-wiring, 2026-09-03, default-ON --
# see dv_harness/config.py's evidence_db block and dv_harness/evidence_db.py).
# Generated locally by every reconciliation cycle; a multi-MB binary file
# with no place in version control.
.dv-harness/evidence/

# Per-run harness RUNTIME STATE under .dv-harness/ (2026-09-03). Everything
# below is rewritten continuously by a live session -- the LSF watcher's PID
# file and log (dv-harness lsf-watch-start), the blackboard's current-truth
# snapshots, the engine's own state/event journal -- so it churns on every
# run and belongs to the machine it was produced on, not to version control.
# Only .dv-harness/evidence/ was previously excluded, which left a careless
# `git add -A` free to sweep a stale watcher.pid (and a multi-MB watcher.log)
# into an unrelated commit.
#
# Two honest caveats, both verified against `git ls-files` on 2026-09-03
# rather than assumed:
#  1. .dv-harness/state.json, .dv-harness/events.jsonl, and several files
#     under .dv-harness/lsf/ and .dv-harness/blackboard/ are ALREADY TRACKED
#     from earlier commits. .gitignore does not apply to tracked files, so
#     their modifications still show in `git status` and can still be staged.
#     These lines stop NEW runtime files from being swept in; they are not a
#     substitute for never running `git add -A` / `git add .dv-harness`.
#     Untracking the already-tracked ones is a separate, deliberate decision
#     (`git rm --cached`) that has not been made here.
#  2. Real, intentionally-versioned content does live under these paths
#     (lsf/*_policy.json, lsf/job_state_schema.json, the blackboard's seed
#     *_state.json files). Add such a file explicitly with `git add -f` --
#     it will not be picked up automatically any more.
.dv-harness/lsf/
.dv-harness/blackboard/
.dv-harness/state.json
.dv-harness/events.jsonl
